{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#1", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡Deja de parlotear!{F801}¡Jamás serviría a un chico!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#18", "es": "{F871}{0100}¿Quieres mi cartera? ¡Inténtalo!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#19", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡No creas que puedes hacer eso y salir vivo de aquí!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#20", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡No te metas con el Ashura-kai!{F801}¡Toma esto!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#21", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡Lo sientooooooo!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#22", "es": "{F871}{0100}Qué chico... Da demasiado miedo...{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#23", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡Basta de tonterías, maldito mocoso!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#24", "es": "{F871}{0100}Espera... ¡¿Vas TAN lejos?!{F801}¡¿De verdad lo vas a hacer?!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#25", "es": "{F871}{0100}¿Qué quieres? ¿Eres idiota?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#27", "es": "{F871}{0100}Jeje... Jajaja... ¡Sí, claro!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#28", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡Ah, y llévate esto también!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneBoss56.mbm#70", "es": "{F871}{0100}¿Entiendes en qué clase de mierda te has metido, chico?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
